      "name": "Animator Updater",
      "slug": "animator-updater",
      "teaser": "Updates weapon animator on Mag Insert",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2686.png",
      "downloads": 5008,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Have you noticed that the AA-12 magazine is sometimes animated? Well, it is animated. However, because of BSG wisdom they forgot that attachment with animation won’t get updated if they’re not a Belt Magazine. With this BepinEx mod, the issue of mags not being animated (even though they are animated) is fixed so you can enjoy that rotating cylinder on a gun that no one use. <em>Or you are planning to have transparent mag with functioning spring</em></p>\n<p>Special thanks to CWX for helping me out, this is the only time where I managed to complete a client mod project.</p>\n<p><strong>Before:</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/YQwW4Df.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/YQwW4Df.gif\" alt=\"YQwW4Df.gif\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>After:</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://imgur.com/hwKyz5x.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgur.com/hwKyz5x.gif\" alt=\"hwKyz5x.gif\" /></a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Install Instruction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Download the Zip</p>\n<p>2. Open the Zip</p>\n<p>3. Copy the content of the Zip your SPT folder</p>\n<p>4. Enjoy</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mZ1aLrW.gif\" alt=\"mZ1aLrW.gif\" /></a></p></div></div></div>\n<p><em>P.S Why did BSG not do this, I am astonished, amazed and questioning</em></p>\n",
